<h1 class="sr-only">江南枝</h1>
<img src="/images/ab064d2d-7c0c-4805-9416-139241b03bbd-f9902224.png" alt="江南枝 - 源自江南原产地的匠心好茶，一盏江南茶，半日闲时光" class="max-w-full h-auto animate-fade-in-up">
<p class="animate-fade-in-up mt-6 text-[#ffffff] font-normal not-italic font-['KaiTi'] tracking-[0.1em] md:tracking-[0.15em] text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-[32px]" style="animation-delay:200ms">— 江南有枝 • 静候知音 —</p>
<a class="inline-block mt-10 px-8 py-3.5 bg-accent text-accent-foreground font-medium rounded-md hover:bg-accent/90 transition-all duration-300 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay:400ms" href="/products">探索茶系列</a>
</div>
</section>
